With great reluctance, President [+ president +] appoints [+ chancellor +] as President of the Council of Ministers.

Immediately, [+ chancellor +] goes to work building a "Worker and Peasant's Spain": confiscation without indemnization of land and tools, rising by decree the wages of all workers, recognicing the right of seccesion to Catalonia, Basque Country and Galicia, leaving Morocco and all the colonies on Africa and supressing the Guardia Civil, Guardia de Asalto and Officers' Corp.

In response, the right-wing forces launches almost immediately launch an attempted coup. Columns of falangists, carlists and nationalists rose up in different points of Spain. The African Army in Morocco joins the coup. Reactionary officers within the Ejercito have taken their troops out of the barracks and joined them with the reactionary forces to stop the KPD from taking power. 

We are forced to be on the same side as the PCE, whether we want to or not.


