@brauns_dilemma
title: There is no clear governing majority.
subtitle: President [+ president +] faces a dilemma.
view-if: president == "Largo Caballero" or president == "Prieto" and (republican_socialist_conjunction < 50 or grand_coalition_failed == 1)

President [+ president +] faces a dilemma. He desperately desires a socialist or at least democratic government, but the electoral results are not there for such. Articles 42 and 80 could be used to stop an incumbing far right governement, it would need the approval of the Cortes. 

- @emergency_braun: We will form an emergency government with [+ president +]'s support.
- @new_elections: We will have new elections.
